From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] eglfs_nxpl: stretch the window to the display

A window smaller than the video mode, e.g. 1280x720 for HbbTV, is then
scaled to the whole screen instead of covering its top left corner.
---
--- a/src/plugins/platforms/eglfs/deviceintegration/eglfs_nxpl/qeglfsnxplintegration.cpp
+++ b/src/plugins/platforms/eglfs/deviceintegration/eglfs_nxpl/qeglfsnxplintegration.cpp
@@ -44,7 +44,9 @@
 	win_info.y = 0;
 	win_info.width = size.width();
 	win_info.height = size.height();
-	win_info.stretch = false;
+	/* scale the window to the display: HbbTV applications are made for a
+	   1280x720 window (QT_QPA_EGLFS_WIDTH/HEIGHT), whatever the video mode */
+	win_info.stretch = true;
 	win_info.clientID = 0;
 	win_info.zOrder = 0;
 
